    {
      "id": 111,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Jobs by conclusion",
      "description": "Job outcomes over time. Rising failure/timed_out share is usually a runner environment problem, not a GARM problem \u2014 but bootstrap_timeout reaping (fleet overview) will confirm.",
